{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-15_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-15","title":"坚城高墙","storyCode":"10-17","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"d858c714dd491f806cc31c31108d7f72147f0acc3ac577ef0ea1e239475797d4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"12-end"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们已经不剩下几个人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在以往的战场上，想要拖住我，维多利亚至少要出动两个以上的蒸汽骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再看看你们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们只是一群普通的士兵而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——保持阵型！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盾还有能量的，跟我站在一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击手，保持火力输出，牵制敌人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，号角！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过——他再强，也只是一个肉体凡躯的萨卡兹感染者而已，他的源石技艺会有极限！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想等法术消耗我的身体？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们根本活不到让我力竭的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莱克！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角，接着我的剑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在倒下的时候，他们向你投去的目光中，竟然还带着希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的光芒，我以为不会在伦蒂尼姆再见到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这微弱的光亮，还能持续多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗本？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......从这里倒下去的话......不过就是......回到......回到......回到伦蒂尼姆的土地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一次性把剩下的弹药全部打了出来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干得不错。你第一次让我停下了脚步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在这之后，你已经无计可施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在看到同伴们一个个死去之后，你也丧失斗志了吗，白狼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹......只要你们占着我们的城市一天，我就始终有战斗的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在想要打倒你这一点上，我和每一个维多利亚人一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的盾没什么用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把剑......呵，也只是一把普通的剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿着这样的剑就想与我战斗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......不要小瞧它，也不要小瞧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你惦记着的......蒸汽骑士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在脱下维多利亚为他们打造的甲胄以后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们也只是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g5_giantwall_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们居然......进来了？这墙为什么变得这么软......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错啊，刚刚那个瞬间，我还以为我的脑袋会在伦蒂尼姆的城墙上开花啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是Misery的源石技艺，他不会让你受伤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......凯尔希跟我说，你的大脑是罗德岛的重要资产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手也不便宜啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了这一趟，我再也不嚷嚷着要搭你便车了......蹭你的源石技艺，还不如让煌抱着我蹦来蹦去更舒服！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说是不是啊，博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的手没停止干活，说明还行。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"被煌提着也舒服不到哪里去。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Misery最好休息一会。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，Misery，我看得很清楚......曼弗雷德那一剑，差点就刺中你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是他无可奈何下的一击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"你成功挑起了他的怒火，这让他忽视了我的靠近。我还以为我骗不了他第二次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是有意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当他质问我的时候，我确实感到了他的愤怒。那怒火是冲我而来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"如果曼弗雷德用上全力，靠他们几个人，拖不了多久。我最好......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Misery，我知道你想去帮那位维多利亚军官，但像今天这样连续使用大规模的物质转换源石技艺，对你的身体损耗太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"......放心吧，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"我一时半会还死不掉。而且，我答应了凯尔希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些精英干员......答应凯尔希医生的事还少吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给自己注射应急药剂。伦蒂尼姆的战斗才刚刚开始，我不想再发现你跑到没人看得见的地方，把几乎吐出来的血一口一口地咽下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，有敌人过来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，拦住他们！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"费斯特，给我绑六根滑索。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔，我们去装炸弹。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，Misery帮我们找到了伦蒂尼姆城防系统的弱点......我们必须毁掉这间控制室。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速度很快——白狼，这才是你的本来面目吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样凶猛的尖牙与利爪，却被维多利亚的贵族礼仪驯化......这真的值得吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨卡兹，你此刻的样貌，难道不曾被所谓的文明包装过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说你们以前可不是这副模样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使你拼尽全力，也依然杀不死我。只要城防系统依然在运转——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等，白狼，你也只是想拖住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——你和罗德岛的人又一次合作了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他们是谁吗？你知不知道那个领头的卡特斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我只知道，他们能阻止你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白狼，万一今天你们真的能成功......那你会亲眼看见伦蒂尼姆的高墙塌下一角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你想见到的吗？永不陷落的伦蒂尼姆，可能从此神话不再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......从此吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你能站在这里，那么......伦蒂尼姆的未曾陷落，就仅仅只是一个自欺的笑话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死！要是让外面那些大公爵注意到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗？你的脸上终于出现了一丝惊慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就说明我的决定是正确的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如这面高墙......存在的意义仅仅是挡住城内维多利亚人的惨叫，那它早就失去了最初的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就该让那些大公爵听一听！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听一听......我们的同胞是如何在你们的屠戮下哭嚎的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我们还有多久能出去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......这通道是不是快完全塌了......我们会不会都死在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别看脚下，也别回头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在害怕的话，看看前面的路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信号灯还亮着。这是我们的战士为我们点亮的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等那点灯光慢慢变亮......我们就能重新看见伦蒂尼姆的日光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的火力太强了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我们根本无法靠近列车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮轰也还没有停下来......下面的人还坚持得住吗？我们还有多少时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官他们也没了消息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我相信我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是支撑我走到这里的唯一理由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，怎么都甩不掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......他刚才的速度你们都看见了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他像故意放慢了脚步，硬是......硬是看我们逃了这么久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么变态啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......听听你们的呼吸声与心跳声。你们终于跑累了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......萨卡兹的荣耀吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这根本称不上一场战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......战斗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对我有些误解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然“魔王”不在，那么这里就根本没有与我匹配的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会与一群肉兽谈论荣耀吗？在你明知道狩猎它们只能带来一些感官刺激，最终它们只配作为一道前菜出现在晚餐饭桌上的前提下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我们......当成猎物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便你是萨卡兹，这种为了个人喜好而大肆杀戮的行径，也未免太野蛮了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要以你们所理解的文明揣度我。这对我而言是最可怕的污蔑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在肮脏的瓦砾把你们砸成肉末之前，试着反抗我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会借由你们的鲜血记录你们临死前的思绪......所有的恐惧，不甘，愤怒......让它们尽情地涌向我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，快过来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，你也退下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要挡在我们所有人面前，与他对抗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是他的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你会被他瞬间撕碎，血肉变成这管道里最不起眼的一摊污迹，你也不准备转身逃走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......你们能跑得比我快一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不为什么。我只是想这样做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们头顶的城市朝我们倒下来的那一刻，我想做最先拥抱它的那一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话......"},{"type":"narration","text":"管道里的信号灯似乎亮了一些。\n是眼花吗？为什么伦蒂尼姆的地下会有星光？不......即使是在地面上，他们也有多久没有见到阴云背后的星星了？\n推进之王眨了眨眼睛。\n她忽然明白过来，那根本不是什么星辰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i18_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一个按钮。\n原本覆于其上的污泥被震落了，现在那个按钮正在发光，而她恰好知道那是做什么的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i18_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"三岁那年，她第一次被带到王宫地下。\n她的老师驮着她，用巨掌引着她按下了这个按钮。\n伦蒂尼姆的地下空间伸展着自己的筋骨，朝未来的王露出了自己生机勃勃的血管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i18_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"二十多年后——\n她第二次见到了它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g5_giantwall_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有节点上的炸弹都安装好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我准备好撤退了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，快来这里，阻止他们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！糟了，他们人怎么来得越来越多......是不是Misery去晚了，他们没拖住曼弗雷德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来拦住他们，你们先走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，把引爆器给我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我得控制住这些敌人，你们才有撤退的机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你们成功撤离，我马上就引爆这间控制室——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们不能再等了，无论是自救军的战士、维多利亚的士兵，还是海蒂小姐与推进之王小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有每一个正在遭受炮轰的维多利亚人，大家都等不了了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，抓住我的手。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"告诉我，什么时候按下引爆的按钮。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......铺天盖地的黑色线条......什么都看不见了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是现在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_boom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您为什么......要挡在我面前？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经......已经不是那个脆弱的小孩子了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不会再拖博士的后腿。我能抵挡住这些法术和烈焰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......捞到你们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，原来你让我提前挂在你腰上的六根滑索是这时候用的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然会行动不便吧......算了，反正你平时也跑不了多快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无人机，起飞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，惊不惊喜？为了回应你的需求，我终于给无人机开发出了——拉人滑翔功能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然续航能力有限，但至少够我们安全落地——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是时候让爆炸来得更猛烈一些了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制室——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......做到了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你早就没有力气了？你甚至都没法再挥剑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然......就只是竭尽全力地站着而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换作别人，你受的这些伤早就够他昏死十次了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这才发现？迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，控制室的爆炸影响了防御炮，炮台连着这一小块墙体结构都遭到了严重破坏——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再不走的话，我们都会摔下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通知所有人，撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这个士兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已经击败了她，但要击倒她，却要再花一些工夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这里已不值得我搭上这些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的白狼，你是个可敬的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你还能活着走下这面城墙的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次见面，我会用我的剑为你送去......配得上你的英勇的死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下一次......"},{"type":"narration","text":"还会有下一次吗？\n伦蒂尼姆的城墙正在塌陷。\n她也在不断下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到......你们离开之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我都没有倒下。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血液的流失让她几乎失去了最后一点知觉。\n但她的身体像是变成了剑与盾的一部分，比铁还硬，除非被打碎，否则绝不弯折。\n维多利亚打造出来的武器，依旧驻在伦蒂尼姆的城墙上。\n维多利亚磨炼而成的战士，也会守在伦蒂尼姆的城墙上。\n直到城墙一角砸向伦蒂尼姆的地面——\n她也会回到生养她的土地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这面墙......到底有多高？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我好像......"},{"type":"narration","text":"......在往上飞？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i19"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i19"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i19"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i19"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"号角，你还能动吗？快抓住我的手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......罗本？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......没......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我没死！我运气好，摔下去的时候抓住了外墙结构，然后又被Misery先生救了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，士兵，你的仗还没有打完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你们啊，就真的不打算让我休息一会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"号角，你别闭眼睛，别忘了，你的士兵还在这里！你不能倒下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗本，你变得就和......和我的某个队员一样吵闹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了......我从来就拿你们没办法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的视野恢复清晰。\n伦蒂尼姆的城墙还在那里，虽然最高处多了一个小小的缺口，但看起来依旧巍峨坚硬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这震动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下结构终于被大炮轰塌了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这震动是来自我们脚下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，你做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我找到了一条可以走的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这截通道......在往上移动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样，我们在这里待了这么长时间，根本就不知道还有这样的机关啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总有一些“本地人”，知道的会比其他本地人更多一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它还会不会追上来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也许不是今天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"竟然找到了新的逃跑方向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......难怪，难怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个气味......是那个菲林散发出来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......所谓王族不过是为了巩固权位而生造出来的谎言，与这个国家的文明一样可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算她是那个逃跑的小狮子，她的血液味道也不会和其他菲林有任何差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那这个截然不同的味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯知道这件事吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你不会有机会追上去确认的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你是谁。你是那个......特雷西斯身边的小学徒。就算你的老师站在这里，他也未必能轻松拦下我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他已经没有资格再当我的老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个咒术的气息......你也来了吗，小女妖？我还以为你正在城里与我的随从们玩游戏。"},{"type":"narration","text":"区区学艺不精的施术者，他们还不足以绊住我的脚步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......这下难办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这即将坍塌的地下通道可不是什么王庭聚首的好地方。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他眼里是不是完全没有我？就因为我既没有跟特雷西斯学过本事，也没什么高贵的血液吗？\n这啰里啰嗦的老头子真的惹恼了我。我要用一百颗炸弹给他开一个欢送晚会，你们没意见吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......汇报情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的人从控制室跳了出去，有那个卡特斯在，我们没办法成功狙击——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下通道的反抗军呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我们侦测到下面发生了爆炸......大君还没回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他受了重伤，目前正昏迷不醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聚集剩下的人手，一队人立刻检查城防系统，汇报损失。我们随时要做好启动更多防御炮......甚至主炮的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人，包围车站。活下来的反抗军一定会从那里走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有......有斥候回报，他们发觉有另一拨人正在迅速靠近车站......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，不要太责怪自己。你已经尽力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎么来了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，快看城墙方向——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城防炮......被关闭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发信号！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来了，大家都上来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是萨卡兹......都在往这里涌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住他们！把他们都杀光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要打退这些萨卡兹，我们就能启动列车！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为你们能轻松走掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么另一个方向也有反抗军？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是援军？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一支队伍从北面冲破了萨卡兹士兵的封锁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......他们是谁叫来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我们之前派出去向中央城区求援的信使还有活下来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨迪恩区的朋友们，你们干得不错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下面的战斗，可以让我们这些更专业的接手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们动起手来......好像要有经验得多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......那是罗德岛干员？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打散他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打出一条通道，确保自救军战士从地下通道安全撤出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击手，干掉那几个通信兵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，孟塔古小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......孟塔古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这名字听起来好耳熟，是不是什么上过报纸的贵族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要分心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管他们是什么身份，我们是站在同一边的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能通行了！快，领着大家上列车！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇......海蒂女士，我们上来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我说过的，我们的战士不会让我们失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是她的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的信使成功联络上了她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更确切地说，是你们罗德岛的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达！快看，是达格达！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群中的达格达也看见了她们。\n她抛下了正与她缠斗的萨卡兹，毫不犹豫地冲到了通道口，朝灰头土脸的伙伴们伸出了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我很怕自己迟到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你没有迟到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我们来说，你什么时候回来，都不算迟到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，你......你走的时候那么干脆，我都来不及揍你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......现在揍也不算太晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，维娜，你知道她会回来的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们瞒着因陀罗我能理解，不到像这样的最后关头，她可能都没法接受贵族雇佣兵的援手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起埋怨我，先一起把这些敌人解决了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我又没停下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，我还没说完......你们起码告诉我一声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你们害得我就连在被追杀的时候，都还惦记着达格达会不会又去了哪个犄角旮旯，准备着和萨卡兹同归于尽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，摩根......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以后都不会了。我发誓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王小组，全体集合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要等到博士他们回来，我们就能一起离开这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我们回来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们居然是从天上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要落地了！大家让一让——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉、拉住滑索！不要撞坏列车，这是我们唯一的逃生工具！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我抱住博士了，我们没问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全落地！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我们居然真的回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官，洛洛有没有事？大家都撤出来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活下来的人比我们预想的要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这多亏了你，费斯特，还有你带来的罗德岛的大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......老比尔，你看到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，别想偷懒晕过去！战斗还没结束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还能动就赶紧来动力室帮我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有萨卡兹士兵在追过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经没什么能做的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们会在这里挡住他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们一起。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官，列车要动了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都准备好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，我们也上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出发！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i10"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯女孩没有回答你。她的身体一动不动，似乎连呼吸都停止了。\n你知道她很震惊。她从未像此刻这样，不加掩饰地将强烈的情绪展露在干员们面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i08_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"与此同时，追赶着列车的萨卡兹都停下来了。\n他们都转过头去，看着同一个方向。\n一个萨卡兹走进了废墟里。\n所有的硝烟都像在她脚下消散，所有的弩声都像在她四周止歇。\n只有风越刮越烈。\n满地灰烬被吹得纷纷扬扬，一部分沾上了她的衣裙，一部分弄脏了她的白发。她仿佛并不介意，只是静静地注视着一处残垣。\n那看起来曾经是城防炮的一部分。不知何时飞来了一只漆黑的羽兽，就站在温热的炮口上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i08_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"可能是被加速的列车惊扰，羽兽抖了抖翅膀。\n有所感应一般，白发萨卡兹转过了身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"她理应看不见列车上的人，但她的表情却像认出了看着她的人是谁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的面庞是那样温和，她的眼睛里却映满了悲哀。这么多的悲哀或许并不全部来自她自己，也来自正看着她的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯女孩终于回过头来。\n她还是没有回答你，你也并不急着要她回答。\n耳边响起了羽兽的鸣叫。你看到窗外有一群羽兽扑棱棱地飞了起来，先你们一步，冲进了前方的大风里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"列车带着你们飞速地驶离车站。\n城墙，战场，以及那个白发的身影，都被远远抛在了后面。\n轰隆。轰隆。轰隆。\n是大脑中炮声的残留，是列车与轨道的碰撞，还是不远处那团阴云中的雷鸣？\n伦蒂尼姆的中心就在眼前。\n而你们正在驶入这场风暴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]}],"observedOperators":[]}
